{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再盘算该收住还是放开，也不靠克制证明清醒，因为两种做法都不能保证不受伤。\",\n      \"key\": \"收住还是放开\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍想被爱、想要更多，却不要求对方接住全部期待，怕眼前的亲近因此失去自在。\",\n      \"key\": \"全部期待\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-2\", \"S14-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得小心靠近、慷慨付出、独自珍藏的快乐，明知会疼仍愿继续认真喜欢、尽情欢喜，不先退开。\",\n      \"key\": \"尽情欢喜\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"对方会不会选择他仍无答案，他却更知对方重要，不拿结果判真心，因为快乐和在意都是真的。\",\n      \"key\": \"仍无答案\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-5\", \"S14-6\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他接受遗憾留在心里，也仍愿喜欢，等不到对方主动靠近会疼，却不否认感情或催回应。\",\n      \"key\": \"接受遗憾\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他发现若总等对方主动靠近，日子便只剩猜测，不能再把喜欢全押在这个答案上。\",\n      \"key\": \"只剩猜测\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-8\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "11f20db4-3e85-4dc0-9d83-05b1e1e4a9da", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T194522304967Z", "elapsed_seconds": 379.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T19:51:41.485724+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalizatio